<view class="container">
  <view class="card hero">
    <view class="section-title">河南 · 艺术报考专区</view>
    <view class="sub-text">统考满分300分；本科默认公式⑤（0.5W+1.25Z），专科统一公式⑤</view>
    <view class="warn-box">艺体报名二选一；须双过线才可投档本科；无官方综合分位次，请用历年最低综合分对标。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{dataSourceStats}}" style="border-left:4px solid {{hasRealData ? '#12b76a' : '#f59e0b'}}">
    <view class="section-title">{{hasRealData ? '✅ 已采集真实录取数据' : '⚠️ 暂无真实录取数据'}}</view>
    <view class="sub-text" wx:if="{{hasRealData}}">
      当前数据库已存储 <strong>{{dataSourceStats.total_records}}</strong> 条河南艺术/体育类院校专业录取综合分
      <block wx:if="{{dataSourceStats.year_coverage}}">
        （2025: {{dataSourceStats.year_coverage.has_2025}} 条，2024: {{dataSourceStats.year_coverage.has_2024}} 条，2023: {{dataSourceStats.year_coverage.has_2023}} 条）
      </block>
      。志愿生成将基于<strong>真实采集数据</strong>进行匹配。
    </view>
    <view class="sub-text" wx:else>
      数据库中暂无艺术类真实录取数据，志愿生成将回退到大模型估算（准确性有限）。
      请联系管理员在后台「数据采集」页面点击「采集艺术/体育数据」获取真实录取分数。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{meta}}">
    <view class="section-title">核心规则</view>
    <view class="rule-item">① 报考互斥：艺术类 / 体育类二选一</view>
    <view class="rule-item">② 双过线：文化课控制线 + 专业统考合格线</view>
    <view class="rule-item">③ 艺术本科批（统考专业）：64个「专业+院校」平行志愿，投档规则与往年一致（分数优先→遵循志愿→一次投档）</view>
    <view class="rhyme">{{meta.rhyme}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">综合分计算</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">文化课成绩 W</text>
      <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.cultureScore}}" data-field="cultureScore" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="高考文化课分数" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">专业统考分 Z（满分300）</text>
      <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.professionalScore}}" data-field="professionalScore" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="艺术统考分" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">文化课控制线 / 专业合格线（选填）</text>
      <view class="inline-fields">
        <input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.cultureCutoff}}" data-field="cultureCutoff" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="文化线" />
        <input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.proCutoff}}" data-field="proCutoff" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="专业线" />
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">批次</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{batchLevels}}" bindchange="onBatchChange">
        <view class="picker">{{form.batchLevel}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item formula-field">
      <text class="label">院校公式编号</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{formulaOptions}}" value="{{form.formulaId - 1}}" bindchange="onFormulaChange">
        <view class="picker picker-short">{{formulaOptions[form.formulaId - 1] || '公式 5'}}</view>
      </picker>
      <view class="formula-hint" wx:if="{{formulaHints.length}}">{{formulaHints[form.formulaId - 1]}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="checkbox-row-wrap">
      <label class="checkbox-row">
        <checkbox value="1" checked="{{form.waive}}" bindchange="onWaiveChange" /> 放弃艺体批次，走普通类志愿
      </label>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="primary-btn" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="calc">计算综合分</button>
      <button class="secondary-btn" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="match">冲稳保对标</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view class="section-title">计算结果</view>
    <view class="result-line">综合分：{{result.composite_score}}</view>
    <view class="sub-text">{{result.formula_label}}</view>
    <view class="warn-box" wx:if="{{result.dual_line}}">{{result.dual_line.message}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{matchResult && matchResult.groups}}">
    <view class="section-title">冲稳保（历年最低综合分对标）</view>
    <view wx:for="{{['rush','steady','safe']}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="tierKey">
      <view class="tier-title">{{tierKey === 'rush' ? '冲刺' : (tierKey === 'steady' ? '稳妥' : '保底')}}</view>
      <view wx:for="{{matchResult.groups[tierKey]}}" wx:key="school_name" class="school-row">
        <view>{{item.school_name}} · {{item.major_name}}</view>
        <view class="sub-text">参考最低综合分 {{item.ref_min_composite}} · 分差 {{item.score_diff}}</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{!matchResult.groups[tierKey].length}}" class="sub-text">暂无</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="goEligiblePool">查看可报院校对标</button>
      <button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="goVolunteer">生成志愿方案</button>
    </view>
    <button class="secondary-btn" style="margin-top:16rpx" bindtap="goProfile">完善艺术类档案</button>
  </view>
</view>
